31ebfd7b79791534", "sha256": "190fa0c6958b212d3c7b55dec9c92056c9b73259da6d8e576c4f5b70928cc1bf"}}, "frozen_pilot_text": [{"id": "exception_with_window", "text": "Company a must submit backup report within 10 days unless emergency.", "text_cid": "bafkreieglf6o6c6re7xr6v746dihuv3mvznd6vrqm24itcezsvndz5foa4"}, {"id": "legal_doc_1", "text": "Banks must not disclose customer information to third parties unless explicit consent or required by law enforcement agencies. Banks must report suspicious activities to financial crimes enforcement network within 30 days of detection. Financial institutions must maintain transaction records for five years if transaction amount exceeds 10000.", "text_cid": "bafkreieg5nrjmv443t5w2c2s3xpvqtiuidd6x5o23dxoy6i4hc4odukuri"}, {"id": "exec_order_1", "text": "Federal agencies must not use chinese manufactured telecommunications equipment if in government communications. Federal agencies must implement zero trust cybersecurity frameworks within 90 days. Federal employees must receive mandatory cybersecurity training annually. Government contractors must report cybersecurity incidents within 24 hours.", "text_cid": "bafkreihqxxhemcp43s43buqwsvdrrbr2yzo3kynirrsnqydxq6gkfvothi"}, {"id": "corp_policy_1", "text": "Employees must not accept gifts from clients or vendors if gift value over 25. Employees must report conflicts of interest to ethics committee within 10 days of discovery. Managers must complete ethics training and certifications annually. Staff must maintain proprietary information and customer data at all times.", "text_cid": "bafkreigrnwepvmrxzcwy45h4wwelwh7sn6bl2c2sgpwhu5barfgxrdpigi"}, {"id": "construction_contract", "text": "Contractor must not subcontract work unless prior written approval. Contractor must not use materials not meeting specification requirements. Client must pay contractor within 30 days of completion. Contractor must complete all construction work by december 31 2024. Contractor must complete work in progress if upon termination notice. Contractor must ensure work compliance with city building codes and standards. Contractor must maintain comprehensive insurance coverage. Parties must attempt mediation before arbitration. Parties must resolve disputes through binding arbitration in springfield illinois. Client may inspect work at any time if with 24 hours advance notice. Client may withhold payment if work does not meet specifications. Either party may terminate agreement with 30 days written notice.", "text_cid": "bafkreiahsaywq5rpcbvhgle4iiucscrvknhyasjprcgtvsfftgcrzzxguq"}], "guard": {"address_space_bytes": 536870912, "cpu_affinity": [0], "cpu_seconds": 25, "kernel_probes": ["socket", "clone3", "write-open"], "landlock_abi": 7, "stdout_stderr_each_max_bytes": 131072, "syscall_denylist": ["socket", "socketpair", "connect", "accept", "accept4", "bind", "listen", "clone", "clone3", "execve", "execveat", "io_uring_setup", "io_uring_enter", "io_uring_register", "pidfd_getfd", "ptrace", "process_vm_writev", "setns", "unshare", "mount", "umount2", "truncate", "ftruncate", "fchmod", "fchmodat", "fchmodat2", "fchown", "fchownat", "utimensat", "setxattr", "lsetxattr", "fsetxattr", "removexattr", "lremovexattr", "fremovexattr"]}, "mode": "after"}
